{"seq":3,"slug":"index-bloat-vacuum-tuning-anti-patterns","title":"索引膨胀、统计信息与失效反模式：VACUUM、REINDEX 与聚簇调优","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/geospatial-backend-postgis-spatial-index-h3-s2/spatial-index-query-plan/index-bloat-vacuum-tuning-anti-patterns","wordCount":2336,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"索引膨胀-统计信息与失效反模式-vacuum-reindex-与聚簇调优\">索引膨胀、统计信息与失效反模式：VACUUM、REINDEX 与聚簇调优</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-三条互不替代的维护路径\">核心概念：三条互不替代的维护路径</h2><p>一个空间索引上线三个月后查询变慢，运维看到的第一反应通常是「重建索引」。但把三种症状混为一谈，是空间数据库运维最常见的判断错误。PostgreSQL 的空间索引维护其实是三个彼此正交的操作面，各自解决一类问题，互相不能替代：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>VACUUM / autovacuum</strong>——回收 MVCC 死元组在堆表和索引里的死条目，让空间可重新利用。它<strong>从不重写索引文件</strong>，因此只能阻止膨胀恶化，不能消除已形成的膨胀。PostgreSQL 18 文档指出，普通 VACUUM 让空间在关系内部可重用，但通常不把磁盘空间还给操作系统（<a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/routine-vacuuming.html\">routine-vacuuming</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>REINDEX</strong>——真正重建索引文件，把稀疏、碎片化的页压实。默认形式持 <code>ACCESS EXCLUSIVE</code> 锁，<code>CONCURRENTLY</code> 只持 <code>SHARE UPDATE EXCLUSIVE</code>（<a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/sql-reindex.html\">sql-reindex</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>CLUSTER</strong>——按某个索引的物理顺序重写整张表，让「同一区域的行落在同一批页上」，降低空间范围查询的堆回表随机 I/O。它同样持 <code>ACCESS EXCLUSIVE</code>，且<strong>聚类状态不被后续写入维持</strong>（<a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/sql-cluster.html\">sql-cluster</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>症状</th>\n<th>根因</th>\n<th>正确动作</th>\n<th>锁与代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>索引体积随死元组单调增长</td>\n<td>死条目未回收</td>\n<td>调 autovacuum，让 VACUUM 跟上</td>\n<td>无阻塞（后台）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>索引体积已膨胀、命中率虚高</td>\n<td>稀疏页已成形</td>\n<td><code>REINDEX CONCURRENTLY</code></td>\n<td><code>SHARE UPDATE EXCLUSIVE</code>，慢、双倍扫描</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间范围查询回表随机 I/O 高</td>\n<td>物理顺序与空间顺序无关</td>\n<td><code>CLUSTER</code> 或 <code>BRIN</code></td>\n<td><code>ACCESS EXCLUSIVE</code>，需表+索引大小的临时空间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计划器选了错的路径</td>\n<td>统计信息过期</td>\n<td><code>ANALYZE</code>，必要时提高统计目标</td>\n<td>读锁，采样扫描</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>判断「该走哪条路」的前提，是能区分这三类症状。下面先讲膨胀是怎么产生的，再讲统计信息如何驱动计划器，最后把失效反模式集中成一张可核对的清单。</p>\n<h2 id=\"膨胀从哪来-死条目-稀疏页与-gist-的特殊性\">膨胀从哪来：死条目、稀疏页与 GiST 的特殊性</h2><p>PostgreSQL 的 MVCC 让 <code>UPDATE</code> 等价于「插入新版本 + 标记旧版本死亡」，<code>DELETE</code> 只是标记。堆表里的死行会连带在<strong>每一个索引</strong>里留下指向它们的死条目（index tuple）。VACUUM 的过程是：扫堆表收集死元组的 TID，然后调用每个索引访问方法的批量删除例程，把指向这些 TID 的条目摘掉（<a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/routine-reindexing.html\">routine-reindexing</a>）。</p>\n<p>关键的限制是<strong>页不会因此被压实</strong>。文档的原话是：B-tree 索引页只有在<strong>完全空</strong>时才会被回收复用；「如果一页上除了少数几个键之外全都已被删除，这一页仍然保持已分配状态」。于是最坏的使用模式——每个键区间里「删掉大部分、留下少数」——会留下大量几乎空的页。</p>\n<p>B-tree 与空间索引在这一点上的差异很实际：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>B-tree 有去重</strong>。PostgreSQL 13 起支持 <code>deduplicate_items</code>（存储参数，默认 <code>on</code>），把重复叶子项合并，低基数键的索引体积可显著下降。<strong>GiST 没有等价机制</strong>——它只删除死元组，不做 B-tree 式的项去重。</li>\n<li><strong>GiST 缺少细粒度诊断函数</strong>。<code>pgstattuple</code> 扩展提供 <code>pgstatindex</code>（B-tree 密度/碎片）、<code>pgstatginindex</code>、<code>pgstathashindex</code>，但<strong>没有 GiST 专用的 <code>pgstat*</code> 函数</strong>。对 GiST，可行做法是对 <code>pg_relation_size()</code> 做时间序列监控，在体积相对活跃数据不成比例增长时触发重建。</li>\n<li><strong>非 B-tree 索引的膨胀研究不足</strong>。PostgreSQL 18 文档说得坦白：「非 B-tree 索引（GiST、GIN、SP-GiST、BRIN、HASH）的膨胀潜力尚未得到充分研究。使用任何非 B-tree 索引时，建议定期监控索引的物理大小。」</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>PostgreSQL 18 收紧了一处历史短板</strong>：此前 GiST 的 VACUUM 无法解除结构上已空的页，删除/回滚密集的 GiST 索引只能靠 <code>REINDEX</code> 恢复文件膨胀。PG 18 的 GiST 访问方法支持了空页删除，使 VACUUM 能回收完全空的 GiST 页；较早版本上 <code>REINDEX</code> 仍是唯一的恢复手段。</p>\n<p>膨胀的量化可以用「索引字节 / 活元组数」这个比值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>bloat</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>index</mtext></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>live</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{bloat}} = \\frac{S_{\\text{index}}}{N_{\\text{live}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">bloat</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">live</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">index</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>index</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\text{index}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">index</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 取自 <code>pg_relation_size()</code>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>live</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{live}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">live</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是索引关联的活元组数。单看绝对值没有意义，关键是<strong>趋势</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>bloat</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{bloat}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">bloat</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 突然抬升就是膨胀或页分裂的信号。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;表写入: UPDATE / DELETE&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;堆表产生死元组&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;每个索引留下指向死 TID 的条目&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D{&quot;VACUUM 是否跟上?&quot;}&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;跟上&quot;| E[&quot;死条目被摘除&lt;br/&gt;空间可复用&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;未跟上&quot;| F[&quot;死条目累积&lt;br/&gt;索引体积单调增长&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; G{&quot;页是否完全空?&quot;}&#10;    G --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| H[&quot;页被回收复用&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt;|&quot;否 (少数存活键)&quot;| I[&quot;稀疏页保持分配&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; J[&quot;趋势监控: 索引字节 / 活元组&quot;]&#10;    I --&gt; J&#10;    H --&gt; J&#10;    J --&gt;|&quot;比值异常抬升&quot;| K[&quot;REINDEX CONCURRENTLY&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"表写入: UPDATE / DELETE\"] --&gt; B[\"堆表产生死元组\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"每个索引留下指向死 TID 的条目\"]\n    C --&gt; D{\"VACUUM 是否跟上?\"}\n    D --&gt;|\"跟上\"| E[\"死条目被摘除&lt;br/&gt;空间可复用\"]\n    D --&gt;|\"未跟上\"| F[\"死条目累积&lt;br/&gt;索引体积单调增长\"]\n    E --&gt; G{\"页是否完全空?\"}\n    G --&gt;|\"是\"| H[\"页被回收复用\"]\n    G --&gt;|\"否 (少数存活键)\"| I[\"稀疏页保持分配\"]\n    F --&gt; J[\"趋势监控: 索引字节 / 活元组\"]\n    I --&gt; J\n    H --&gt; J\n    J --&gt;|\"比值异常抬升\"| K[\"REINDEX CONCURRENTLY\"]</pre><h2 id=\"统计信息-计划器凭什么选中空间索引\">统计信息：计划器凭什么选中空间索引</h2><p>空间查询「有时快、有时慢」的多数案例不是索引坏了，而是<strong>统计信息过期导致计划器估错代价</strong>。计划器的决策本质是比较两条路径的估算代价：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>seq</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>row</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>idx</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>startup</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>hit</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>heap</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{seq}} \\approx N \\times c_{\\text{row}}, \\qquad C_{\\text{idx}} \\approx C_{\\text{startup}} + N_{\\text{hit}} \\times c_{\\text{heap}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">seq</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">row</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">idx</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">startup</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">hit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">heap</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>因为回堆取行是随机 I/O（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>heap</mtext></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>row</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{heap}} &gt; c_{\\text{row}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8252em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">heap</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">row</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），当估算命中率超过几个百分点时，顺序扫描反而更快。这个估算的输入就是<strong>选择性</strong>（selectivity）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>hit</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>query</mtext></msub><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{hit}} \\approx N \\times \\frac{A_{\\text{query}}}{A_{\\text{total}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">hit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">query</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>注意这里是<strong>面积比</strong>而不是边长比。窗口边长减半，命中行数只降到四分之一——这对大表上的「宽视口」查询意味着计划器会合理地放弃索引。空间索引的选择性统计依赖 <code>ANALYZE</code> 采样，而空间列的统计是<strong>有损</strong>的（对象是 MBR 分布，不是精确几何），所以 <code>ANALYZE</code> 的时效性直接决定计划稳定性。PostGIS 官方排障指引的第一条就是：索引被忽略时先看 <code>EXPLAIN</code>，再跑 <code>VACUUM ANALYZE</code>（<a href=\"https://postgis.net/docs/using_postgis_dbmanagement.html\">using_postgis_dbmanagement</a>）。</p>\n<p>PostgreSQL 18 在这里提供了新的可控性：<code>VACUUM</code> 和 <code>ANALYZE</code> 现在<strong>默认处理继承子表</strong>（旧行为可用新增的 <code>ONLY</code> 选项还原），<code>pg_upgrade</code> 默认保留优化器统计信息（扩展统计不保留）（<a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/release-18.html\">release-18</a>）。这两条对空间分区表升级尤其相关——分区父表本身从不被 autovacuum 处理，历史上升级后容易出现统计真空。</p>\n<p>监控统计新鲜度用 <code>pg_stat_all_tables</code> 的 <code>last_autovacuum</code> / <code>last_autoanalyze</code> / <code>n_dead_tup</code>，索引使用情况用 <code>pg_stat_user_indexes</code> 的 <code>idx_scan</code> / <code>last_idx_scan</code>（<a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/monitoring-stats.html\">monitoring-stats</a>）。一个容易踩的坑：<code>n_dead_tup</code> 是<strong>估算值</strong>，累计统计在非干净停机后会重置；<code>idx_scan = 0</code> 也不等于索引无用（可能只是统计刚被重置）。判断「未使用索引」时，必须同时确认它不承担主键/唯一/排除约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"失效反模式清单-从-不走索引-到-锁住生产库\">失效反模式清单：从「不走索引」到「锁住生产库」</h2><p>空间查询性能事故大多可以归入几类可机械检查的反模式。把它们列成核对表，比事后翻慢查询日志有效得多——计划怎么读见同章 <a href=\"spatial-query-explain-plan-analysis\">空间查询计划分析：EXPLAIN 与执行器内部</a>，索引选型的代价模型见 <a href=\"spatial-index-rtree-gist-brin\">空间索引原理：R-Tree、GiST、SP-GiST 与 BRIN 的包围盒代价模型</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反模式</th>\n<th>为什么失效</th>\n<th>修正</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>WHERE ST_Distance(geom, $1) &lt; 100</code></td>\n<td><code>ST_Distance</code> 不是 index-aware 函数，逐行计算距离</td>\n<td>改用 <code>ST_DWithin(geom, $1, 100)</code>，它内部对查询几何的<strong>扩展包围盒</strong>做 <code>&amp;&amp;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>WHERE ST_Relate(a.geom, b.geom, &#39;...&#39;)</code> 无 <code>&amp;&amp;</code></td>\n<td><code>ST_Relate</code> 本身不带上索引算子</td>\n<td>显式加 <code>a.geom &amp;&amp; b.geom AND ST_Relate(...)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>WHERE ST_Intersects(ST_Transform(geom, 3857), $1)</code></td>\n<td>列上套函数，索引对表达式无效</td>\n<td>在查询常量上转换，或建表达式索引 <code>USING GIST (ST_Transform(geom, 3857))</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>WHERE geom::geography &lt;-&gt; $1 &lt; 1000</code></td>\n<td>类型转换破坏索引匹配</td>\n<td>对 geography 列建 geography GiST 索引，或统一列类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖 <code>CLUSTER</code> 保持有序</td>\n<td>聚类不被后续写入维持</td>\n<td>配合低 <code>fillfactor</code>，或改 <code>BRIN</code> + 定期 <code>brin_summarize_new_values</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生产库直接 <code>REINDEX INDEX</code></td>\n<td>默认 <code>ACCESS EXCLUSIVE</code>，阻塞全部查询与写入</td>\n<td>用 <code>REINDEX INDEX CONCURRENTLY</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长事务 / 空闲复制槽长期存在</td>\n<td>VACUUM 只能清理任何保留快照都不再需要的版本</td>\n<td>结束长事务、清理陈旧复制槽（PG13+ 有 <code>max_slot_wal_keep_size</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>autovacuum 反复被取消</td>\n<td>长 <code>ANALYZE</code> 等冲突锁可饿死 autovacuum（防回卷 VACUUM 除外）</td>\n<td>监控 autovacuum 日志，缩短冲突操作</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关于 <code>CLUSTER</code> 的代价，文档给了精确的临时空间要求：索引扫描式聚类需要 <strong>表大小 + 全部索引大小</strong>；若计划器选择「顺序扫描 + 排序」，峰值可达 <strong>2× 表大小 + 全部索引大小</strong>，此时可用 <code>SET enable_sort TO off</code> 禁用排序路径（<a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/sql-cluster.html\">sql-cluster</a>）。聚类后务必 <code>ANALYZE</code>，否则计划器对新物理顺序一无所知。</p>\n<p><code>REINDEX CONCURRENTLY</code> 不是免费的：它对每个索引做<strong>两次表扫描</strong>，并等待所有可能使用该索引的现存事务结束。它时刻只能有一张表上一次并发重建，且<strong>不能</strong>在事务块中运行。失败时有确定的恢复路径——唯一索引冲突会留下无效索引：<code>..._ccnew</code> 是未完成的过渡索引（<code>DROP INDEX</code> 后重跑），<code>..._ccold</code> 是未能删除的原索引（重建其实已成功，直接删除即可）。排除约束索引无法并发重建（<a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/sql-reindex.html\">sql-reindex</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;空间查询变慢&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, BUFFERS)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C{&quot;是否使用空间索引?&quot;}&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| D{&quot;谓词是否 index-aware?&lt;br/&gt;列上是否套了函数/转换?&quot;}&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;反模式命中&quot;| E[&quot;改写 SQL 或建表达式索引&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;谓词合法&quot;| F[&quot;VACUUM ANALYZE 后重看计划&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G{&quot;计划是否改变?&quot;}&#10;    G --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| H[&quot;统计过期: 调 autovacuum 逐表阈值&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| I[&quot;RANDOM_PAGE_COST 与选择性核算&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;是但慢&quot;| J{&quot;索引体积 / 活元组 是否异常?&quot;}&#10;    J --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| K[&quot;REINDEX CONCURRENTLY&quot;]&#10;    J --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| L[&quot;回表随机 I/O: 考虑 CLUSTER 或 BRIN&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"空间查询变慢\"] --&gt; B[\"EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, BUFFERS)\"]\n    B --&gt; C{\"是否使用空间索引?\"}\n    C --&gt;|\"否\"| D{\"谓词是否 index-aware?&lt;br/&gt;列上是否套了函数/转换?\"}\n    D --&gt;|\"反模式命中\"| E[\"改写 SQL 或建表达式索引\"]\n    D --&gt;|\"谓词合法\"| F[\"VACUUM ANALYZE 后重看计划\"]\n    F --&gt; G{\"计划是否改变?\"}\n    G --&gt;|\"是\"| H[\"统计过期: 调 autovacuum 逐表阈值\"]\n    G --&gt;|\"否\"| I[\"RANDOM_PAGE_COST 与选择性核算\"]\n    C --&gt;|\"是但慢\"| J{\"索引体积 / 活元组 是否异常?\"}\n    J --&gt;|\"是\"| K[\"REINDEX CONCURRENTLY\"]\n    J --&gt;|\"否\"| L[\"回表随机 I/O: 考虑 CLUSTER 或 BRIN\"]</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>空间索引的维护要把三件事拆开看：<strong>VACUUM 防膨胀、REINDEX 消膨胀、CLUSTER 改物理顺序</strong>，三者的锁代价与适用症状完全不同，混用只会把「查询慢」变成「停机重建」。膨胀的机制是 MVCC 死条目加上「页只有全空才回收」的复用规则，而 GiST 既没有 B-tree 的去重、也没有 <code>pgstatindex</code> 级诊断函数——只能靠 <code>pg_relation_size()</code> 趋势监控与 PG18 的空页回收兜底。统计信息则决定计划器是否愿意用索引，对一亿行级别的空间表，按表压低 autovacuum 的 scale factor 通常比手动 ANALYZE 更稳。</p>\n<p>落地口径浓缩为三条：索引体积/活元组趋势异常时 <code>REINDEX CONCURRENTLY</code>；<code>EXPLAIN</code> 显示索引被忽略时先 <code>VACUUM ANALYZE</code> 再调逐表阈值；确认走索引但回表慢时，评估 <code>CLUSTER</code> 或换 <code>BRIN</code>（后者建索引约快 10 倍、体积最多小 1000 倍，但要求物理顺序与空间顺序低重叠，且不支持 kNN）。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"索引膨胀、统计信息与失效反模式：VACUUM、REINDEX 与聚簇调优","id":"索引膨胀-统计信息与失效反模式-vacuum-reindex-与聚簇调优"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三条互不替代的维护路径","id":"核心概念-三条互不替代的维护路径"},{"level":2,"text":"膨胀从哪来：死条目、稀疏页与 GiST 的特殊性","id":"膨胀从哪来-死条目-稀疏页与-gist-的特殊性"},{"level":2,"text":"统计信息：计划器凭什么选中空间索引","id":"统计信息-计划器凭什么选中空间索引"},{"level":2,"text":"失效反模式清单：从「不走索引」到「锁住生产库」","id":"失效反模式清单-从-不走索引-到-锁住生产库"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"空间查询与执行计划分析：`&&`、ST_Intersects、KNN 距离排序与 EXPLAIN","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/geospatial-backend-postgis-spatial-index-h3-s2/spatial-index-query-plan/spatial-query-explain-plan-analysis"},"next":{"title":"H3 与 S2 网格模型：六边形/四叉层级、单元 ID 与分辨率取舍","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/geospatial-backend-postgis-spatial-index-h3-s2/h3-s2-grid-proximity-service/h3-s2-grid-model-resolution"}}